    "title": "UNet EfficientNet-B4 Building Instance Segmentation",
    "description": "UNet with EfficientNet-B4 encoder for building instance segmentation from very high resolution RGB aerial imagery. Trained on hotosm/vhr-building-segmentation (18 557 quality-filtered chips). Outputs three channels: binary mask logit, normalised Euclidean distance transform (EDT), and boundary logit. Instance segmentation is performed via marker-controlled watershed on the EDT channel at inference.",
